{
  "tema": 7263,
  "slug": "ya-ya-no",
  "titulo": "Ya / ya no = now, already, finally, not anymore",
  "subtitulo": "¡Ya voy! Ya tenía dos hijos. Ya no fumo.",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "Ya = now, right away (¡Ya voy!), already (ya tenía dos hijos), finally (¡ya llegó!). Ya no = not anymore (ya no fumo).",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "usos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "forma": "ya = now / right away",
              "texto": "With the present or a command: **¡Ya voy!**, **¡Cállate ya!**"
            },
            {
              "forma": "ya = already",
              "texto": "Any tense: **ya tenía dos hijos**, **ya lo sé**."
            },
            {
              "forma": "ya = finally",
              "texto": "Usually with the preterite, after a long wait: **¡Ya llegó la primavera!**"
            },
            {
              "forma": "ya no = not anymore",
              "texto": "Any tense: **ya no te quiero**, **ya no vivía ahí**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In Mexico **ya** is everywhere: **¿Ya?** (_Done?_), **¡Ya!** (_Enough! / Done!_), **ya mero** (_almost_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **ya** is the moment something clicks; **ya no** is when it stops."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ahora",
      "titulo": "Now",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "—Laura, ven. —¡==Ya== voy!",
              "en": "—Laura, come here. —Coming!"
            },
            {
              "es": "—No has sacado la basura. —==Ya== la saco.",
              "en": "—You haven't taken out the trash. —I'm doing it now."
            },
            {
              "es": "¡Cállate ==ya==!",
              "en": "Shut up already!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ya-mismo",
      "titulo": "Already",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "En ese entonces, ella ==ya== tenía dos hijos.",
              "en": "Back then, she already had two kids."
