            {
              "es": "==Ya== tengo internet. Antes no había.",
              "en": "I have internet now. Before there wasn't any."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi hijo ==ya== hablaba mucho a los dos años y medio.",
              "en": "My son was already talking a lot at two and a half."
